    "name":  "Modular Pole 6-Piece Aluminum 2.5 Meters | With Water Tank | Ø58mm",
    "reference":  "91565",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e2.5 Meter Modular Aluminum Pole\u003c/strong\u003e is the ideal solution to install street lights and solar luminaires in gardens, plots, paths, and outdoor areas. Made of \u003cstrong\u003eresistant aluminum\u003c/strong\u003e and composed of \u003cstrong\u003e6 modular pieces of 450 mm\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated water tank\u003c/strong\u003e for stability. Tube of \u003cstrong\u003eØ58 mm diameter\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eModular Pole 6 Pieces Aluminium 2.5 Metres | With Water Tank | Ø58mm\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e2.5-Metre Modular Aluminium Pole\u003c/strong\u003e is a professional, versatile and highly functional solution designed for the installation of \u003cstrong\u003esolar streetlights, LED luminaires and outdoor lighting systems\u003c/strong\u003e in all types of environments. Thanks to its innovative design, lightweight structure and modular system, it has become one of the most practical and efficient options for lighting projects in gardens, pathways, housing estates, plots, rural areas and public spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade from \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-resistance aluminium\u003c/strong\u003e, this pole guarantees excellent durability against the elements, corrosion, humidity and extreme weather changes. Unlike traditional steel or concrete poles, aluminium offers a perfect combination of \u003cstrong\u003estructural lightness and robustness\u003c/strong\u003e, making both transport and installation easier without the need for heavy machinery.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSmart modular design for fast and efficient installation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of the great differentials of this pole is its construction in \u003cstrong\u003e6 modular pieces of 450 mm\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing simple, quick assembly that is fully adaptable to project needs. This modular system not only reduces installation times, but also facilitates storage, transport and on-site handling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts snap-fit design is intended to provide a firm and stable structure once assembled, ensuring optimum performance even in demanding outdoor installations. This feature makes it an ideal solution for both professional installers and autonomous or domestic lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eReinforced stability with integrated water tank\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe pole incorporates an \u003cstrong\u003eintegrated water tank system at the base\u003c/strong\u003e, specifically designed to provide greater stability without the need for complex foundations. This system allows the base to be filled with water to increase the overall weight, improving wind resistance and ensuring secure fixing on different types of ground.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks to this solution, the pole can be installed either \u003cstrong\u003etemporarily or permanently\u003c/strong\u003e, adapting to events, temporary installations or definitive lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eUniversal compatibility with solar streetlights\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a \u003cstrong\u003etube diameter of Ø58 mm\u003c/strong\u003e, this pole is specially designed to offer optimal compatibility with a wide range of solar luminaires, including models such as:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nSolar streetlights \u003cstrong\u003eEcoSun\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nLuminaires \u003cstrong\u003eGardenSun\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nUrban lighting systems \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis universal compatibility makes it a highly sought-after option for energy efficiency projects, sustainable lighting and modernisation of outdoor spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRecommended applications and uses\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 2.5-Metre Modular Aluminium Pole is ideal for a wide variety of applications, including:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPrivate and community garden lighting\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nRural roads, pathways and pedestrian access\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nHousing estates and residential areas\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPublic parks and recreational areas\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPlots, estates and agricultural holdings\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nTemporary installations for outdoor events\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nAutonomous solar lighting projects\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you are looking for a reliable, durable and easy-to-install solution for outdoor lighting projects, this modular pole is the ideal choice for sector professionals, electrical installers and renewable energy projects.\u003c/p\u003e",
